\ Interpreter-free variant: the well-known partial-dispatch marker serialized
\ onto `case`'s definition must resolve through lookupWellKnownMarker back to
\ the static singleton on image load, so the freshly-pushed marker compares
\ equal to it even without an interpreter fallback.

partial-dispatch partial-dispatch = .
"case" word-markers [ partial-dispatch = ] #filter #count 0 > .
